on in the draft. The supplied quotation is paraphrased with its evidential point and author attribution preserved. There is no translated-quotation finding. F1 concerns the source support of non-quoted prose, rather than quotation voice or idiom. General editorial and mechanical review were not undertaken.\n\nCompletion status: complete. Unresolved findings: F1 remains in the supplied draft; the supported repair above has not been applied because this task authorises only the report.\n"}"}], "internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough": {"turn_id": "01a0f778-385b-76c1-b8f2-0236f45872a7", "create_time": 1790860052.832791}}}
